## 4. Block Properties

### block.timestamp Manipulation

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - using timestamp for randomness
function random() external view returns (uint256) {
    return uint256(keccak256(abi.encodePacked(block.timestamp)));
    // Miners can manipulate by ~15 seconds
}

// VULNERABLE - exact timestamp comparison
function unlock() external {
    require(block.timestamp == unlockTime);  // May never match!
}

// SECURE - use ranges
function unlock() external {
    require(block.timestamp >= unlockTime);
}
```

### block.number on L2

```solidity
// On Arbitrum/Optimism:
// block.number = L1 block number (not L2!)
// Use block.timestamp for time-based logic

// Arbitrum specific:
// ArbSys.arbBlockNumber() = L2 block number
```

