## 6. External Call Behavior

### Gas Forwarding

```solidity
// .call forwards all available gas
(bool success,) = target.call{value: amount}("");
// 63/64 of gas forwarded (EIP-150)

// .transfer and .send limit to 2300 gas
payable(target).transfer(amount);  // Can fail for contracts!

// SECURE - use call with success check
(bool success,) = target.call{value: amount}("");
require(success, "Transfer failed");
```

### Return Data Bomb

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - unbounded return data copy
function vulnerable(address target) external {
    (bool success, bytes memory data) = target.call("");
    // Attacker returns massive data, consumes all gas copying
}

// SECURE - limit return data
function secure(address target) external {
    assembly {
        let success := call(gas(), target, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0)
        // Only copy expected return data size
        if success {
            returndatacopy(ptr, 0, min(returndatasize(), 64))
        }
    }
}
```

