## 8. Events

### Indexed Parameters

```solidity
// indexed parameters are searchable but limited
event Transfer(
    address indexed from,    // Can filter by this
    address indexed to,      // Can filter by this  
    uint256 indexed amount   // Can filter, BUT hashed for >32 bytes!
);

// For strings/bytes, indexed stores keccak256 hash
event Log(string indexed message);  // Can only filter by hash!
```

