## EVM Audit Checklist

- [ ] Storage layout compatible for upgrades
- [ ] Assembly operations maintain memory safety
- [ ] External calls handle return data correctly
- [ ] block.timestamp not used for randomness
- [ ] L2-specific block properties understood
- [ ] CREATE2 addresses verified by code hash
- [ ] Return data bomb attacks prevented
- [ ] Gas forwarding appropriate for use case
- [ ] Default values don't create false positives
